# Requests for VS Code REST Client, Rider or Visual Studio. Start the mocks (docker compose up -d) and the service first.
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Sample inventory event (wiremock/__files/sample-event.json)
POST {{host}}/_dev/messages
Content-Type: application/json

< ../../wiremock/__files/sample-event.json

### Same change replayed with a new eventId: skipped as DuplicateVersion
POST {{host}}/_dev/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "msg-0002",
  "eventType": "SellerInventoryChanged",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "sellerId": "boutique-42",
  "productId": "style-123",
  "sizeId": "size-38",
  "countryCode": "PT",
  "availableQuantity": 3,
  "sourceVersion": 7
}

### Older version arriving late: skipped as StaleVersion (send a version 8 first to see it)
POST {{host}}/_dev/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "msg-0006",
  "eventType": "SellerInventoryChanged",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-20T07:59:00Z",
  "sellerId": "boutique-42",
  "productId": "style-123",
  "sizeId": "size-38",
  "countryCode": "PT",
  "availableQuantity": 10,
  "sourceVersion": 6
}

### Inactive product: 422 ProductInactive
POST {{host}}/_dev/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "msg-0100",
  "eventType": "SellerInventoryChanged",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "sellerId": "boutique-42",
  "productId": "style-9999",
  "sizeId": "size-38",
  "countryCode": "PT",
  "availableQuantity": 1,
  "sourceVersion": 1
}

### Availability API keeps failing (seller-503): 503 after retries
POST {{host}}/_dev/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "msg-0200",
  "eventType": "SellerInventoryChanged",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "sellerId": "seller-503",
  "productId": "style-123",
  "sizeId": "size-38",
  "countryCode": "PT",
  "availableQuantity": 1,
  "sourceVersion": 1
}

### Upload the 10,000-row CSV (multipart/form-data, field "file")
POST {{host}}/v1/availability/imports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=upload

--upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="bulk-stock.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../wiremock/__files/bulk-stock.csv
--upload--

### Job status (paste the jobId returned by the upload)
GET {{host}}/v1/availability/imports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Latest applied stock for a key
GET {{host}}/_dev/stock/boutique-42/style-123/size-38?countryCode=PT

### Events waiting to be published again
GET {{host}}/_dev/outbox
